  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_elysm",
      "name": {
        "en": "Elysium's Badge",
        "zh": "极境证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_elysm",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Elysium has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for raising allied morale in the field.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Vanguard Operator during field operations to exercise Standard Bearer responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员极境擅长在战场上振奋同伴士气\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为先锋干员，行使执旗手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_elysm",
      "name": {
        "en": "Emergency Callbook",
        "zh": "应急通讯指南",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_elysm",
      "description": {
        "en": "Call Log 012-1177\n'Hello? You there? I'm in big trouble!'\n'What's up? Someone bust your head open?'\n'Even worse!!!'\n'Where are you?'\n'The usual place...'\n\nCall Log 013-1177\n'Calling back so soon? Something happen?'\n'[PROLONGED LAUGHTER]'\n'......'\n'Sorry, I gotta laugh a little longer—[LAUGHTER]'\n'...Quit it! This is life or death to me!\n'Just—okay, I owe you! If we can get this all properly sorted, I'll treat you to the best stuff!'\n'Sure.\n'Whatcha want me to do?'\n'First—don't tell anybody about this!'\n\nCall Log 025-1177\n'Stuff's here.'\n'Phew! Great, now bring it over!'\n'You've been holed up in there for three days now.\n'Medical's people are worried about you. Got any excuses I can still feed them?'\n'Trust me, I've got a good feeling about this. This'll all work out, guaranteed!\n'This little treasure comes from a Higashinese salon! Takes effect lightning fast, pushes rewind on even the worst cases, apparently! Tons of good reviews online too!'\n\nCall Log 028-1177\n'How is it?'\n'...Don't think it's doing anything.\n'You think I should turn the temperature up a little more? Or maybe give it a few more hours?'\n'You got duped again. Just knock it off already, it's like a bad comedy routine.\n'I'm gonna go fetch a Medic to sort your troubles out.'\n'Wait, don't, don't go—'\n'Did you run dry? I thought you'd throw out even more of your promises to get me to stop.'\n'......'\n'Hello? You still there?'\n\nCall Log 273-1000\n...go.\n'Is that... you, captain?'\n...sistance.\n'...Is this an SOS?\n'Your signal's a little weak. I even have the amplifier on.\n'Please repeat instructions.'\nSendi... coordin...\n'Coordinates?\n'...Coordinates received.\n'I'm heading out now!'\n\nCall Log 029-1177\n'Elysium? Where are you?'\n'An emergency call came in. I've gotta run this mission first.'\n'Huh? Don't you have, uh, something else weighing on your head?'\n'Don't remind me!!'\n\nCall Log 277-1000\n...Every base station's been destroyed. You're the last one.\nThanks to you, reinforcements arrived with time to spare.\nDidn't think you'd still be carrying that thing.\n'You mean this pager-receiver? Should've been decommissioned forever ago, you're right. [LAUGHTER] I was just... rummaging through some old stuff at the time.'\nUh-huh.\nBy the way, your hair—your 'lightning bolt' do, is that the new thing?\nPeople keep laughing the moment they see you. I think everyone likes it.\n'No, no, listen, it was an accident!!!'",
        "zh": "通讯记录012-1177\n“喂？在吗？我摊上大事了！”\n“怎么，你头被人打破了？”\n“比这还严重！！！”\n“你在哪？”\n“老地方……”\n\n通讯记录013-1177\n“这么快打回来，出了什么问题？”\n“哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈——”\n“……”\n“不行让我再笑一会儿哈哈哈——”\n“……别笑了！这件事对我来说真的很重要！\n“算我欠你一个人情只要能够妥善解决之后我一定会好好犒劳你！”\n“好吧。\n“要我做什么？”\n“首先——不要告诉任何人！”\n\n通讯记录025-1177\n“东西到了。”\n“太好了，快送过来吧！”\n“你已经闭门不出三天了。\n“医疗部的人很担心你，还有什么借口能应付他们？”\n“相信我，我有一种强烈的预感，这回绝对没问题！\n“这秘宝来自一家东国的美容院，据说见效神速，再严重都能恢复如初，网上有很多好评呢！”\n\n通讯记录028-1177\n“怎么样了？”\n“……好像没什么效果。\n“你说我要不要再调高一点温度？或者再多等几个小时？”\n“你又被骗了，快结束这场闹剧吧。\n“我现在就去找医疗干员解决你的烦恼。”\n“等、不要去啊——”\n“就这？我还以为你又要喋喋不休地提出诱人条件来阻止我。”\n“……”\n“喂，你还在吗？”\n\n通讯记录273-1000\n……走。\n“这是……队长？”\n……救。\n“……求援代码？\n“讯号有点微弱，我已经开启增幅器了。\n“请复述指令。”\n发送……坐标……\n“坐标？\n“……坐标已收到。\n“我立刻出发！”\n\n通讯记录029-1177\n“极境？人呢？”\n“来了条紧急通讯，我得先去执行任务。”\n“啊？那你的头等大事不管了？”\n“不要提醒我这件事！！”\n\n通讯记录277-1000\n……所有的基站都被毁了，你就是最后一条。\n多亏了你，援兵很及时。\n没想到你还带着它。\n“您是指这台早该弃用的寻呼收讯器？啊哈哈……当时我恰好在收拾旧物啦。”\n嗯。\n顺带一问，你的发型——那撮“闪电形”的红发，是新设计的？\n大家见到你就笑，看来都很喜欢。\n“不，不是的，那是个意外啊！！！”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
